</span>(<span class="ff1">路由信息协议</span>)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y23e ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.5.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本概念</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y23f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">RIP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>是内部网关协议<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(<span class="ff6">IGP</span>)<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>中最早得到广泛使用的协议。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y240 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">核心机制<span class="ff4">：基于</span>距离向量<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Distance V<span class="_ _2c"></span>ector) <span class="ff4">算法的分布式路由选择协议。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y241 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">距离定义<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Metric)<span class="ff4">：使用“跳数”作为度量。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y242 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">直连网络跳数为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">1</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y243 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">每经过一个路由器，跳数加<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">1</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y244 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">最大限制<span class="ff4">：允许的最大路径长度为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">15</span>。若距离为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">16</span>，则表示不可达。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y245 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.5.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">工作原理<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(<span class="ff1">三个关键点</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y246 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">RIP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">协议的运行遵循以下三个核心规则：</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y247 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">和谁交换<span class="ff4">：仅和</span>相邻<span class="ff4">的路由器交换信息。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y248 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">交换什么<span class="ff4">：交换当前本路由器所知道的</span>全部信息<span class="ff4">（即整个路由表）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y249 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">何时交换<span class="ff4">：按固定的时间间隔交换（例如每隔<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">30<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>秒<span class="ff4">）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y24a ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.5.3<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">距离向量算法<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(<span class="ff1">路由表更新规则</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y24b ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">当收到相邻路由器<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑋<span class="_ _9"> </span></span>发来的路由表时，执行以下步骤：</div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">16<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
